  "body": "Experience this brand-new luxury residence in prestigious Long Bay, thoughtfully designed to offer exceptional layout flexibility and modern architectural elegance. Tailored for multi-generational living, this property comfortably caters to the dynamic needs of modern families.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the ground floor features an open-plan lounge and dining area, seamlessly connected to a modern main kitchen complete with a practical Butler's Pantry. A separate living room provides an ideal formal reception area or a quiet relaxation zone. Perfect for extended family or guests, the ground floor also includes a private bedroom suite with its own walk-in wardrobe and full bathroom, complemented by a separate guest powder room and a double internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, central accommodation flows around a secondary family living area. The upper level provides two bedroom suites, including a principal suite with a dedicated study area, walk-in wardrobe, and ensuite, alongside a second ensuite bedroom. Two further bedrooms share a full family bathroom, completing a functional and well-balanced top floor.\r\n\r\nBeyond the front door, the vibrant Long Bay community offers excellent everyday convenience. You are positioned just moments from the local New World Supermarket, neighborhood cafes, and highly regarded local schooling including Long Bay College. This home offers a lifestyle of quality, convenience, and adaptable family living. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
